# Morrowind vampirism, Clan Quarra: catching Porphyric Hemophilia and the turn, carried by Skyrim's vampirism.
# The Quarra vampires of the Alen, Hleran and Serano tombs (Vampire_Quarra gives each its blood) attack a stranger
# and flee after a few blows (authored Flee 70), so the player seeks out each in turn; their hits pass on "Vampire
# Blood Quarra", which converts as Skyrim's vampire disease (10% a hit). Three days on, a sleep in Caius Cosades'
# bed turns the player: VampireCheck starts Vampire_Quarra_PC (PCVampire 1, VampClan 3, the clan's Specials) and
# Skyrim's PlayerVampireQuest.VampireChange makes the player a Skyrim vampire.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case va_quarra_infect
approach 05C348B1
wait 200
approach 05C1A20D
wait 200
approach 05463D12
wait 200
approach 053CA885
wait 200
approach 0537958A
wait 200
approach 057C29B8
wait 200
approach 05503C49
wait 200
approach 054EF661
wait 200
approach 05530D70
wait 200
approach 0590E077
wait 200
approach 05ED797E
wait 200
approach 05443103
wait 200
approach 056873B9
wait 200
approach 05321B14
until 600 player->GetSpell "Vampire Blood Quarra" == 1
end

case va_quarra_turn
run
player->PositionCell -60 -30 60 0 "Balmora, Caius Cosades' House"
until 300 GetPCCell "Balmora, Caius Cosades' House" == 1
wait 60
rest 120 05201D4E PCVampire == 1
expect VampClan == 3
expect player->GetSpell "Vampire Quarra Specials" == 1
expect player->GetSpell "Vampire Sun Damage" == 0
expect player->GetSpell "Vampire Blood Quarra" == 0
end
